[
  {
    "_comment": "GROK · The world_csv tests with the storage swapped to S3: the same grok calls and the same assertions, reading the staged world CSVs from an S3 domain instead of a local fs one. Only the publishers differ. Every test is a pub->tfr->sub chain over gk_src (S3Src with SrcFileFormat.LOG, globbing the staged world CSVs out of the S3 domain's bucket prefix) / gk_ops and gk_sink (the SAME transformer and subscriber objects as world_csv, imported by gk_s3wc.py -- both are connection-less). Generated by gen_suites.py."
  },
